# reports.bug — Found & Fixed Bugs

> Module: reports (Raporlama) | Category: ANALYTICS  
> Created: 02 June 2026

### B-REP-01: Initial SQL Column Name Mismatches

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Severity** | P2 — Medium |
| **Status** | ✅ **FIXED** (02 June 2026) |
| **Found** | First build — API returned 500 |
| **Bug** | SQL queries used wrong column names: `cikis_tarihi` should be `baslangic_tarih`, `kamyon_id` should be `truck_id`, `sofor_id` should be `sofor` (text field). Assumed schema structure that didn't match the actual DB schema. |
| **Root Cause** | Handler written from blueprint assumptions rather than checking actual schema. |
| **Fix** | Checked actual DB schema with `\d trips`, `\d trucks`, etc. Rewrote all SQL queries with correct column names. |
| **Verified** | API returns 200 with valid JSON structure. UI renders with charts and tabs. |

No open bugs. Module is fully functional.
